ent covering what was set up, platform URLs, posting cadence, and next steps.","clientApprovalRequired":false},{"id":"training-complete","name":"Training Completion","description":"Client training on Metricool and Meta Business Suite completed and signed off.","clientApprovalRequired":true}],"training":[{"id":"metricool","name":"Metricool","scope":"Initial orientation — scheduling posts, reading analytics, managing the content calendar, and team access.","competencies":["Can log in to Metricool independently","Can schedule a post to all connected platforms","Can view and interpret the analytics dashboard","Can manage and adjust the content calendar","Can invite and manage team members","Understands notification settings and inbox integration"]},{"id":"meta-business-suite","name":"Meta Business Suite","scope":"Initial orientation — managing the unified inbox, viewing page insights, and understanding account structure.","competencies":["Can log in to Meta Business Suite independently","Can navigate and respond in the unified inbox (Messenger + Instagram DMs)","Can view Facebook and Instagram page insights","Can locate and manage connected accounts"]}]}'::jsonb),
  ('operating-partnership', '{"qualification":[{"id":"need-understood","label":"Business need understood — operational systems, not a launch requirement"},{"id":"decision-maker","label":"Decision maker identified and engaged"},{"id":"budget-confirmed","label":"Budget range confirmed ($3,499/month minimum)"},{"id":"service-fit","label":"Service fit confirmed — retainer appropriate, not a one-time project"},{"id":"assessment-scoped","label":"Assessment scoped and priced ($3,500–$5,000)"},{"id":"assessment-proposed","label":"Assessment proposal issued"},{"id":"assessment-signed","label":"Assessment agreement signed"},{"id":"assessment-paid","label":"Assessment fee received"},{"id":"kickoff-scheduled","label":"Assessment kickoff scheduled"}],"assets":[{"id":"business-overview","name":"Business Overview","category":"Context","required":true,"description":"Business model, services offered, target customers, team structure"},{"id":"org-chart","name":"Team / Org Chart","category":"Context","required":false,"description":"Who does what — including contractors or key vendors"},{"id":"platform-list","name":"Technology & Platform List","category":"Systems","required":true,"description":"All software, platforms, and tools currently in use"},{"id":"crm-access","name":"CRM Access","category":"Access","required":false,"description":"CRM system login — stored in Laminar secure credential vault"},{"id":"analytics-access","name":"Analytics Access","category":"Access","required":false,"description":"Google Analytics, Search Console, or other reporting tools — credentials in vault"},{"id":"website-access","name":"Website / Hosting Access","category":"Access","required":false,"description":"GitHub, Cloudflare, or other hosting access — credentials in vault"},{"id":"existing-sops","name":"Existing Process Documentation","category":"Context","required":false,"description":"Any SOPs, checklists, or process documents already in use"},{"id":"kpi-baseline","name":"KPI Baseline Data","category":"Context","required":false,"description":"Revenue, lead volume, conversion rates, or other metrics the client currently tracks"},{"id":"pain-points","name":"Known Pain Points","category":"Context","required":true,"description":"Client-identified operational problems, bottlenecks, or priorities going into the assessment"}],"deliverables":[{"id":"assessment-report","name":"Operational Assessment Report","description":"Current-state review, gap analysis, risk findings, and recommendations.","clientApprovalRequired":false},{"id":"roadmap","name":"12-Month Improvement Roadmap","description":"Prioritised initiative list with timelines, owners, and expected outcomes.","clientApprovalRequired":true},{"id":"kpi-dashboard","name":"KPI Dashboard","description":"Agreed metrics framework with baseline values and tracking method established.","clientApprovalRequired":true},{"id":"monthly-review-notes","name":"Monthly Operating Review Notes","description":"Written record of each operating review — priorities, decisions, and next actions.","clientApprovalRequired":false},{"id":"capacity-report","name":"Monthly Capacity Report","description":"Hours used by activity category and outcomes completed each month.","clientApprovalRequired":false},{"id":"quarterly-audit","name":"Quarterly Systems Health Audit","description":"Assessment of platform health, workflow performance, and roadmap progress.","clientApprovalRequired":false},{"id":"sop-library","name":"Process Documentation Library","description":"SOPs, workflow diagrams, and process notes produced during the engagement.","clientApprovalRequired":false},{"id":"graduation-summary","name":"Graduation / Handoff Summary","description":"Final documentation of all systems built, outcomes achieved, and recommended next steps.","clientApprovalRequired":true}],"training":[{"id":"operating-review","name":"Monthly Operating Review","scope":"How to prepare for and participate in the monthly operating review so the meeting produces useful decisions rather than status updates.","competencies":["Comes to each review with a prepared list of operational issues or decisions needed","Understands how to read the capacity report and what it means for roadmap progress","Can identify which roadmap items are blocked and articulate why","Knows how to request additional capacity and understands the approval process","Understands the difference between in-scope work and a change order"]},{"id":"kpi-dashboard","name":"KPI Dashboard","scope":"Reading and interpreting the KPI framework established during onboarding — what the metrics mean and how to act on them.","competencies":["Can locate and open the KPI dashboard independently","Understands what each metric measures and why it was chosen","Can identify when a metric is trending in the wrong direction","Knows which metrics are Laminar''s responsibility to maintain vs. client''s responsibility","Can add context or notes when a metric change has a known cause"]},{"id":"sop-library","name":"Process Documentation","scope":"Navigating, using, and maintaining the SOP library built during the engagement.","competencies":["Can locate any documented process in the SOP library","Understands how SOPs are structured and what each section means","Can identify when a documented process needs updating and how to flag it","Can follow a documented process independently without Laminar''s involvement","Understands that deviating from documented processes should be discussed before changing, not after"]}]}'::jsonb)
)
update public.playbook_versions version
set definition = coalesce(version.definition, '{}'::jsonb) || canonical_sections.sections
from canonical_sections join public.playbooks playbook on playbook.code = canonical_sections.code
where version.playbook_id = playbook.id;

